// ===== Social Science question-bank expansion =====
//
// Merged into SSC_MCQS / SSC_SHORT_QA / SSC_LONG_QA in study-data.ts.
// IDs run from 5000 upward (base bank tops out at 4002), so collisions are
// impossible and expansion content is identifiable at a glance.
//
// TWO GAPS THIS PACK TARGETS:
//
// 1. LONG-ANSWER COVERAGE. Seven of the twenty chapters had no long answer
//    at all — Forest & Wildlife, Minerals & Energy, Democracy & Diversity,
//    Gender/Religion/Caste, Political Parties, Outcomes of Democracy, and
//    Sectors of the Indian Economy. Every one of those now has coverage.
//
// 2. HARD TIER. The base bank had 2 hard MCQs against 78 total, which meant
//    the adaptive engine could essentially never serve a genuine hard
//    question in this track.
//
// SSC chapter ids are continuous 1-20 across the four sub-subjects:
//   hist 1-4 | geo 5-10 | polsci 11-16 | eco 17-20

